<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to authorise the execution of guarantees
for the repayment of loans made to certain sporting
bodies.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_39d7efe9-07fa-4652-9b9d-14be1e6002d6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_879c2922-4f15-496f-9e50-c547f9a95349"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1977-003" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Sporting Bodies&#8217; Loans Guarantee Act
1977</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_165c899f-4173-449a-97ec-2df3f98db7b6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_1e3c85a0-059c-472d-b8ee-8c58c2dbf8c7"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, <defterm type="definition"
guid="_f67cbaa8-8a03-49f1-86af-f5f6dbb08e08"
id="def.sportingbody"><b><i>sporting body</i></b></defterm> means a body or an
association of persons, whether incorporated or unincorporated, formed for, or
having as its object, the control, development or promotion of any form of
lawful physical recreational activity engaged in competitively, but does not
include a body or association that:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_44a969fb-ea41-47de-af3d-f350c9cc68a6" id="sec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">conducts horse or greyhound racing,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f0d96c98-ebb4-4409-becf-3945cf15b88b" id="sec.2-para1.b"
status="repealed">
<no>(b)</no>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>
</li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 2:</b> Am 1998 No 113,
Sch 2.15.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b0ee31c5-10f1-4699-b1e4-19288c360369"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_0ce1468a-72c5-4e6a-be10-a59583f7686f"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Guarantees</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9552539e-c12c-49c1-8b89-1c5d9998ccfa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may execute a guarantee, either
alone or jointly with some other person, in favour of a bank, building society
or credit union, or another person or a body of persons, whether corporate or
unincorporate, for the repayment of money expended or to be expended
on:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6bdd9c7f-7c50-4bd4-b550-25c571a66870" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the acquisition of land, or land and buildings
thereon,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_665d2589-4b72-4605-a0d6-aadf0d193720" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the construction, improvement or alteration of
buildings, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7146f947-65ad-43a4-a325-455a209b8d69" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the acquisition of items of plant or equipment
that have or are to become fixtures,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">by a sporting body in connection with the provision by
it of sporting facilities.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cd18b2a1-5f03-48ac-a68b-a22ffcd76e2b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister shall not execute a guarantee under
subsection (1) if the amount of the guarantee:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_84f3ab19-f600-4eb7-ba97-ea3be78a2ca4" id="sec.3-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">exceeds 90 per centum of the estimated value of
the land or land and buildings, of the estimated cost of the works of
construction, improvement or alteration, or of the estimated value of the
plant or equipment, as the case may be, that estimated value or cost to be
ascertained in such manner as the Minister may direct, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7c8fd6a5-bc76-4b15-8a55-fac0aa79880e" id="sec.3-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">together with the amounts of all other guarantees
executed, or approved by the Minister to be executed, under subsection (1)
(excluding guarantees no longer in force), exceed such amount as may, from
time to time, be fixed by the Treasurer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f5366709-eb12-4e68-8c4e-cf8b84ea2214"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The execution by the Minister, either alone or
jointly with some other person, of a guarantee under subsection (1) shall, in
favour of the creditor, be conclusive evidence that the requirements of this
Act with respect to the guarantee have been complied
with.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1996 No 24,
Sch 1.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b69b4ee7-ebdf-4084-b281-425314353498"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_a5931f21-cc11-4a92-91c3-d52f5729c710"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Provisions relating to guarantees</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f7b23283-bf65-4517-9afa-e6ed1e0a0f65"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subsection (2), a guarantee executed
under section 3 (1) may be subject to such terms and conditions as the
Minister thinks fit.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_267de224-87a1-4e04-8788-2ce34eb828fb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The following provisions shall apply to and in
respect of a guarantee executed under section 3 (1):</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6fe3f7b8-1437-4a9d-be25-127a302b3599" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">The guarantee may include any interest charges
and expenses chargeable by the creditor against the principal debtor and the
expenses of enforcing or obtaining or endeavouring to enforce or obtain
payment of the debt guaranteed and those interest charges and
expenses.</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_16934e7d-d05a-43b0-b498-b9280d000bab" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">The guarantee may be expressed to include
compound interest.</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b92cabad-6674-4d61-b0f2-41ba5de4d0d9" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">The creditor shall, if required to do so by the
Minister, obtain, take and hold or retain and hold securities for the payment
of the principal debt of such nature as the Minister may
require.</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_348e4a0f-357c-4aa9-b525-9078abf68d8d" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">The guarantee shall not be enforceable against
the Minister unless and until the creditor has exercised the creditor&#8217;s
rights and remedies under all securities held by or for the creditor in
respect of the debt guaranteed, other than the guarantee.</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e69dac03-fd7a-4ff8-87ba-663591ea0c96" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">The creditor shall not, without the consent in
writing of the Minister, assign or encumber the benefit of the
guarantee.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5aefbe66-1e68-4580-be2c-7967214834d0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_8b7f3329-ebd8-424a-baea-8ab07c1ef2ef"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Payments under guarantees</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any amount payable under a guarantee executed
under this Act shall:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1ee4bc7d-ac44-43d3-8a01-a4862851d117" id="sec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">despite the provisions of the <legref
refid="act-1996-086" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Public Lotteries Act 1996</i></name></legref>, be paid out
of the Sport and Recreation Fund established under section 34 of that Act,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d30cbeb1-450b-43ed-8a60-7c0b4c5093cf" id="sec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">where the fund referred to in paragraph (a) is
insufficient to cover the amount payable, be paid by the Treasurer, without
further appropriation than this Act, out of the Consolidated Revenue
Fund,</txt></block></li></list>

<txt break.before="1">or be paid partly as referred to in paragraph (a) and
partly as referred to in paragraph (b).</txt></block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 5:</b> Am 1996 No 86,
Sch 1.4.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_84f4a6e1-f624-4f40-9e6f-171a83b4a69f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_a090eca8-3d49-4f47-9256-9b0930fafa6e"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></level>
</content>


